  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "White steel is a rank six immortal material and one of the earth vein essences. White steel extract is the rank seven material drawn from it; often only a small bowl of extract comes from a huge piece of white steel.",
      "chapters": [
        1600
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "grade-and-yield",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "res_white_steel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tie Qu Zhong buys dragonfish so his rank seven edge Gu can be fed for now, but treats dragonfish as a temporary replacement and wants a white steel extract resource point in his immortal aperture to be self sufficient. Shang Hu Zhang understands he wants that resource point to feed edge Gu, and Shang clan can assist for a price.",
      "chapters": [
        1600
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feeding-edge-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_qu_zhong",
        "gu_edge_immortal_gu",
        "char_shang_hu_zhang",
        "fac_shang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan extorts the production method and construction materials for the white steel extract resource point from Shang clan. White steel bowl valley is a medium sized resource point that, once built, coagulates rank seven white steel extract at the valley center, letting him feed rank seven edge Gu himself. After plundering Tie Qu Zhong’s immortal aperture he had found no feed resources for edge Gu, then learned from soul search that Tie Qu Zhong meant to build this point.",
      "chapters": [
        1616
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "white-steel-bowl-valley",
